{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 16 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生理时序模型：门控、膨胀卷积、长状态与领域预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Temporal Physiological AI</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_079_heartbeit-title\">HeartBEiT</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">将标准版式 ECG 渲染为图像，以 BEiT 式离散 masked-patch prediction 预训练专用 ViT。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Renders standard 12-lead ECG waveforms as 2D layout images and pretrains a Vision Transformer via BEiT-style discrete masked patch token prediction on 8.5 million ECGs.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">按标准版式渲染的 12 导联 ECG 图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Standardized 2D image rendering of a 12-lead clinical electrocardiogram</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">ECG 诊断分类概率或迁移表征</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Pretrained ECG ViT representation for low-label arrhythmia, LVEF, and STEMI classification</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41746-023-00840-9\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_079_heartbeit')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_079_heartbeit')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"HeartBEiT original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/ac535782d0e0fcbc75df.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_079_heartbeit\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_079_heartbeit')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_079_heartbeit\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">12 导联波形</span><span class=\"lang-en\">12</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">原始 ECG 被裁切、标度并排版为临床样式图像</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests standardized 2d image rendering of a 12-lead clinical electrocardiogram and prepares initial tensor representations (12).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"原始 ECG 被裁切、标度并排版为临床样式图像\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests standardized 2d image rendering of a 12-lead clinical electrocardiogram and prepares initial tensor representations (12).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"12 导联波形\" data-node-name-en=\"12\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">12 导联波形</span><span class=\"lang-en\">12</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">原始 ECG 被裁切、标度并排版为临床样式图像</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests standardized 2d image rendering of a 12-lead clinical electrocardiogram and prepares initial tensor representations (12).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"模型实际输入是二维波形图，不是原始采样序列 token\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes ECG to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"ECG 渲染图\" data-node-name-en=\"ECG\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">ECG 渲染图</span><span class=\"lang-en\">ECG</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">模型实际输入是二维波形图，不是原始采样序列 token</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes ECG to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"切分固定大小 patch 并线性嵌入为 ViT tokens\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs patches within the core ecg image masked pretraining transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"图像 patches\" data-node-name-en=\"patches\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">图像 patches</span><span class=\"lang-en\">patches</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">切分固定大小 patch 并线性嵌入为 ViT tokens</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs patches within the core ecg image masked pretraining transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"大比例 patch 替换为 mask token，保留可见上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs masked within the core ecg image masked pretraining transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"随机遮挡\" data-node-name-en=\"masked\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">随机遮挡</span><span class=\"lang-en\">masked</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">大比例 patch 替换为 mask token，保留可见上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs masked within the core ecg image masked pretraining transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"BEiT-style tokenizer 为被遮挡 patch 提供离散 code targets\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs discrete objective within the core ecg image masked pretraining transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"离散视觉目标\" data-node-name-en=\"discrete objective\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">离散视觉目标</span><span class=\"lang-en\">discrete objective</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">BEiT-style tokenizer 为被遮挡 patch 提供离散 code targets</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs discrete objective within the core ecg image masked pretraining transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"Vision Transformer 从可见 ECG 形态建模跨导联与长程空间关系\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs HeartBEiT encoder within the core ecg image masked pretraining transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"HeartBEiT 编码器\" data-node-name-en=\"HeartBEiT encoder\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">HeartBEiT 编码器</span><span class=\"lang-en\">HeartBEiT encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">Vision Transformer 从可见 ECG 形态建模跨导联与长程空间关系</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs HeartBEiT encoder within the core ecg image masked pretraining transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"预训练时预测 masked patch 的离散 token\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs masked prediction within the core ecg image masked pretraining transformer computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"掩码预测头\" data-node-name-en=\"masked prediction\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">掩码预测头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">masked prediction</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">预训练时预测 masked patch 的离散 token</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs masked prediction within the core ecg image masked pretraining transformer computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用全局 token/pooled representation 做多标签分类\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies fine-tuning to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"诊断微调头\" data-node-name-en=\"fine-tuning\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">诊断微调头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">fine-tuning</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用全局 token/pooled representation 做多标签分类</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies fine-tuning to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"节律、结构或其他 ECG 标签概率\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces pretrained ecg vit representation for low-label arrhythmia, lvef, and stemi classification via output.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"诊断输出\" data-node-name-en=\"output\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_079_heartbeit', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">诊断输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">节律、结构或其他 ECG 标签概率</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces pretrained ecg vit representation for low-label arrhythmia, lvef, and stemi classification via output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"HeartBEiT Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · ECG 图像遮挡 patch 的离散 token 预测</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Maske